 "decisions": {
  "mg996r": "no match: no MG996R/MG996/MG995/TowerPro record; the generic standard RC servo envelopes are 50 x 20 x 42 mm boxes and the Futaba S3003 is a different servo (57.75 x 20 x 41.74 mm overall). Recreated PR #170's simplified MG996R parametrically: src/purchased/mg996r.py.",
  "nema11": "no exact match: only generic 'analytic simplified' NEMA 11 bodies of 20/28/34/40/48/60 mm (28.2 mm frame, no 45 mm). Used the manufacturer's STEP already in the repo (hardware/vendor-files/stepperonline-11hs18-0674s/cad/11HS18-0674S.STEP): src/purchased/nema11.py.",
  "solenoid_412": "no match: no JF-0530B/0530B/JF0530/TAU0730TM/Adafruit 412 record; the only solenoid is adafruit_413_large_solenoid (Adafruit 413, 29 x 24 x 69.7 mm vs 24.2 x 14 x 51.9 mm). Recreated PR #170's simplified model parametrically: src/purchased/solenoid_412.py."
